      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REDEMPTION LASS (2) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (16.97) at Murray Bridge Straight. Returns to a course where she has performed well. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Looks the one to beat on her best form. ONCE A DIVA (8) was a big winner two back scoring by half a length then got further back last time but came home hard into third and beaten 4 lengths at Gawler (23.05). Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Bold showing expected. SHE'S GOT DESIGN (5) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 20.20 beating Life Of Riley. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. LIFE OF LUXURY (1) can run a bold race on best form.",
